{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">有「鬼馬填詞人」之稱的著名填詞人黎彼得病逝，終年 76 歲。黎彼得生前曾參演無綫處境劇《愛·回家之開心速遞》，為劇中Rap組合「大四喜」成員之一，其搞笑演出深受觀眾喜愛。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"jackhero5_1786007072_3957631985915400095_566958223.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026JAkBxUkJVD1786013605.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"jackhero5_1786007072_3957631985915400095_566958223.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">對於黎彼得離世，同劇飾演「送水輝」的演員許家傑在社交平台上載了一張與「大小姐」林淑敏及黎彼得的合照，以作悼念。他在帖文中留言表示不捨：「多謝 Peter 哥（黎彼得先生）帶俾我哋嘅經典作品同埋你嘅笑容，能夠同你合作係我哋嘅榮幸🙌🏻Love you 🫶🏻」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"jackhero5_1786007072_3957632037337579019_566958223.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026oK3e4UaitV1786013612.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"jackhero5_1786007072_3957632037337579019_566958223.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T11:19:07.315321+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}